Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and two untapped Mountains and have Lightning Bolt in hand, with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 5 life and controls Propaganda (creatures can't attack them unless their controller pays {2} for each). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-mana-empties-attack-tax | Unused mana empties at the end of each step and phase (CR 106.4), so the floating red can't pay Propaganda's {2} in the declare attackers step (CR 508.1h): spend it on Lightning Bolt now and keep both Mountains for the attack tax; tapping a Mountain for Bolt leaves too little to attack
